turns.response:
What about the heartbeat pulsing through your body? Is it separate from you as well. What is the difference between just a thought and our own thoughts: do we not have them too because they’re part of who/what makes us up and how could there possibly only ever be one way to experience any single realization or emotion if this were true
Infinity is the answer. It means that when you say “I” with confidence, it’s because your soul knows what they are talking about – not just some random person who happens upon their own insight along life’s journey but rather someone whose entire being recognizes this truth as well!
So you can understand why I say we should take into account all of these factors before making any judgments on ourselves or others;
